{%- doc -%}
  The brown paper bakery bag. Cookies peek out of the top as it fills (CSS reads data-fill
  on the parent), and the baker's twine around it is the free-delivery meter (--progress).
  The twine pattern lives in the shared SVG sprite.
{%- enddoc -%}
<svg class="bag-art" viewBox="0 0 120 150" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
